    "props": {
      "description": "<ul><li><p>As an action, change into <strong>Steel Form</strong>, <strong>Mana Form</strong> or <strong>Formless</strong>.</p></li><li><p>While Formless, at the start of your turn you may change into Steel Form or Mana Form for free.</p></li><li><p><strong>Formless:</strong> DEF equals your DEX die, MDEF your INS die.</p></li><li><p><strong>Steel Form:</strong> DEF <strong>16</strong>. Spells deal <strong>10</strong> extra damage to you.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mana Form:</strong> MDEF <strong>16</strong>. Attacks deal <strong>10</strong> extra damage to you.</p></li></ul>",
